---
description: >-
  Compatibility-mode twin of label-syntax.mmd (D734, #1397): the same packet labels with
  legacyMarkdown set. No packet label kind read markdown in v12, so the picture is expected to
  equal the default one: only a quoted markdown string is markdown, tags draw and `\n` breaks.
config:
  legacyMarkdown: true
---
packet
  title "`title **bold** _ital_`"
  0-31: "field **bold** _ital_"
  32-63: "`field **bold** _ital_`"
  64-95: "field a `code` b"
  96-127: "field <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  128-159: "field one\ntwo"
